{"id":"d97e4cff9496e188","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-powers-universal.md","title":"Powers Preserve Universal Formulas","display":"Powers Preserve Universal Formulas","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-powers-universal","aliases":["93-lem-powers-universal"],"display":"Powers Preserve Universal Formulas","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-powers]]","[[93-df-quasi-equation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-powers-universal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-powers-universal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Powers Preserve Universal Formulas"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"10bfe2126b30365e\" href=\"?note=10bfe2126b30365e\" title=\"93-df-powers\">93-df-powers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a6af4ddc68cbdc4\" href=\"?note=1a6af4ddc68cbdc4\" title=\"93-df-quasi-equation\">93-df-quasi-equation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-powers-universal---Powers-Preserve-Universal-Formulas\">lem-powers-universal - Powers Preserve Universal Formulas</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(X=\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(I\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\\)</span> are the syntax and satisfaction relations of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1a6af4ddc68cbdc4\" href=\"?note=1a6af4ddc68cbdc4\" title=\"93-df-quasi-equation\">93-df-quasi-equation</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}\\)</span> is the direct-power constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"10bfe2126b30365e\" href=\"?note=10bfe2126b30365e\" title=\"93-df-powers\">93-df-powers</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}powers\\text{-}universal}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land I\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,X)\n\\land\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\\langle E,e\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau)\n\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\\langle E,e\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}powers\\text{-}universal}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land I\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,X)\n\\land\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\\langle E,e\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau)\n\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\\langle E,e\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Quasi-equations are the universal Horn formulas formalized in this book and are preserved by direct powers. Arbitrary universal sentences need not be product-preserved.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-powers-universal---Powers-Preserve-Universal-Formulas","text":"lem-powers-universal - Powers Preserve Universal Formulas","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-powers","status":"resolved","id":"10bfe2126b30365e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-powers]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quasi-equation","status":"resolved","id":"1a6af4ddc68cbdc4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-quasi-equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quasi-equation","status":"resolved","id":"1a6af4ddc68cbdc4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,X)$ and $\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}$ are the syntax and satisfaction relations of [[93-df-quasi-equation]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-powers","status":"resolved","id":"10bfe2126b30365e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}$ is the direct-power constructor of [[93-df-powers]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}powers\\text{-}universal}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land I\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{QEq}_{93}(E,e;\\tau,X)\n\\land\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\\langle E,e\\rangle\\\\\n&\\to\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau)\n\\models^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau,X}\\langle E,e\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1287,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["10bfe2126b30365e","1a6af4ddc68cbdc4"]}